{"assets":["/statement-assets/2e67a38eeeb0c26e8c713ee8f51f6205ff2cca77f12069c17bb1554e52501b86.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"802","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"J3. Send the Fool Further! (hard)"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Heidi is terrified by your estimate and she found it unrealistic that her friends would collaborate to drive her into debt. She expects that, actually, each person will just pick a random friend to send Heidi to. (This randomness assumption implies, however, that she can now visit the same friend an arbitrary number of times...) Moreover, if a person only has one friend in common with Heidi (i.e., if that person is in a leaf of the tree), then that person will not send Heidi back (so that Heidi's travel will end at some point)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Heidi also found unrealistic the assumption that she can make all the travels in one day. Therefore now she assumes that every time she travels a route between two friends, she needs to buy a new ticket. She wants to know: how much should she expect to spend on the trips?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For what it's worth, Heidi knows that Jenny has at least two friends."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the number of friends "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3 ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines each contain three space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ u, v ≤ n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ c ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":") meaning that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" are friends and the cost for traveling between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" (paid every time!)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is again guaranteed that the social network of the input forms a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Assume that the expected cost of the trips is written as an irreducible fraction "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a / b"},{"kind":"text","text":" (that is, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" are coprime). Then Heidi, the weird cow that she is, asks you to output "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/2e67a38eeeb0c26e8c713ee8f51f6205ff2cca77f12069c17bb1554e52501b86.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". (Output a single integer between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 6"},{"kind":"text","text":".)"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n0 1 10\n0 2 20\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"15\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n0 1 3\n0 2 9\n0 3 27\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n0 1 3\n0 5 7\n1 2 2\n1 3 1\n1 4 5\n5 6 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"400000019\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"11\n1 0 6646\n2 0 8816\n3 2 9375\n4 2 5950\n5 1 8702\n6 2 2657\n7 2 885\n8 7 2660\n9 2 5369\n10 6 3798\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"153869806\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n0 1 8\n0 2 24\n1 3 40\n1 4 16\n4 5 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"39\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, with probability "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 / 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" Heidi will go to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":", and with probability "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 / 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" she will go to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":". In the first case the cost would be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":", and in the second it would be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"20"},{"kind":"text","text":". After reaching "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" she will stop, as "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" are leaves of the social tree. Hence, the expected cost she has to pay is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10·1 / 2 + 20·1 / 2 = 15"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, the expected cost is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"81 / 5"},{"kind":"text","text":". You should output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"400000019"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In her travels, Heidi has learned an intriguing fact about the structure of her social network. She tells you the following: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The mysterious determinant that you might be wondering about is such that it does not cause strange errors in your reasonable solution..."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" Did we mention that Heidi is a weird cow?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"J3","problemCode":"802J3","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/802/problem/J3"}